/-- (pm16, sub-`5/2` scan) **The diagonal near-wedge pin (arc-2 clamped)**:
with the SECOND arc's lifted projections clamped at `47/20`, the far-wedge
branch of the diagonal dies against the clamped arc's three-step kill
