/-- `s` is not an ear: `DIAG_IS_NOT_EAR_p35` at the QKNVMLB2 context. -/
theorem QKNVMLB2_step01_notEar_p35 (s : ScsV39) (p q : ℕ) (hscs : isScsV39 s)
